  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AVRR Assistance Provided to Chinese Nationals in Denmark Implemented by the International Organization for Migration Mission in China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish Refugee Council (DRC) is implementing a return and reintegration counselling project financed by the Danish Immigration Service and the Ministry of Immigration and Integration. The project aims at offering counselling and support to victims of human trafficking and other vulnerable groups of migrants who wish to return, for them to successfully reintegrate in their country of origin or country of residence. DRC provides information, counselling and assistance in the preparation of return, while counselling and reintegration assistance tailored to individual needs after return is provided through the International Organization for Migration&#x2019;s office in the People&#x2019;s Republic of China.</narrative>
  </description>
